{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban charities from posting donation bags through letter boxes unless requested",
        "additional_details": "These bags should only work on request to prevent plastic waste.",
        "background": "Ban all charity shop bags from being delivered to homes. These generate lots of plastic waste and sometimes they are posted through letter boxes regardless of need or want. We think this would save plastic waste and prevent distressing dogs.",
